{"id":"e9ef09a86db92f05","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-regularity-package.md","title":"ZFC Regularity Package","display":"df-zfc-regularity-package — ZFC Regularity Package","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-regularity-package","aliases":["58-df-zfc-regularity-package"],"display":"df-zfc-regularity-package — ZFC Regularity Package","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-lebesgue-measurable]]","[[58-df-baire-property]]","[[58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property]]","[[58-df-powerset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-regularity-package"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-regularity-package</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-regularity-package — ZFC Regularity Package"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b8b3b1a1bbba5e8\" href=\"?note=3b8b3b1a1bbba5e8\" title=\"58-df-lebesgue-measurable\">58-df-lebesgue-measurable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5b9f71b20826f2d\" href=\"?note=b5b9f71b20826f2d\" title=\"58-df-baire-property\">58-df-baire-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"125313f7bdb0c910\" href=\"?note=125313f7bdb0c910\" title=\"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property\">58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(X,\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> (standard topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S\\)</span> (Lebesgue-measurable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3b8b3b1a1bbba5e8\" href=\"?note=3b8b3b1a1bbba5e8\" title=\"58-df-lebesgue-measurable\">58-df-lebesgue-measurable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BaireProperty}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BaireProperty}_S\\)</span> (Baire-property predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b5b9f71b20826f2d\" href=\"?note=b5b9f71b20826f2d\" title=\"58-df-baire-property\">58-df-baire-property</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S\\)</span> (perfect-set-property predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"125313f7bdb0c910\" href=\"?note=125313f7bdb0c910\" title=\"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property\">58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularityPackage}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularityPackage}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}regularity\\text{-}package} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularityPackage}_S(\\Gamma,X) \\leftrightarrow X=\\mathbb R\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\\land \\mathrm{BaireProperty}_S(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}regularity\\text{-}package} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularityPackage}_S(\\Gamma,X) \\leftrightarrow X=\\mathbb R\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\\land \\mathrm{BaireProperty}_S(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PerfectSetProperty}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every set in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> has the three classical regularity properties on the real line: Lebesgue measurability, the Baire property, and the perfect set property.</li>\n<li>Each component now uses its sourced predicate with the required ambient topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lebesgue-measurable","status":"resolved","id":"3b8b3b1a1bbba5e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-lebesgue-measurable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-baire-property","status":"resolved","id":"b5b9f71b20826f2d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-baire-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-perfect-set-property","status":"resolved","id":"125313f7bdb0c910","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading